                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZQZLb",
                  "name": "libHint",
                  "fill": "#8A8A8A",
                  "content": "灰名单不参与决策（不拦截也不放行），仅作画像标注——其确切用途属悬空点 G-05，待确认。黑白名单同时命中时黑名单优先（G-04）。",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "JpgCQ",
              "name": "cfgNote",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tZqQE",
                  "name": "cfgNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "tlkwS",
                  "name": "cfgNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "jn722",
                      "name": "cfgNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 条件树用 JSON 结构存储与编辑，禁止字符串表达式（免注入，且可双向绑定，AD-07）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LCiTz",
                      "name": "cfgNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 分值范围 0~100；多条规则累加超过 100 时截断为 100（悬空点 G-03）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rb3PP",
                      "name": "cfgNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 新建/编辑规则默认 status=disabled，需先在仿真页验证再启用（PRD 2.3.7-3 流程）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "dn5Bb",
                      "name": "cfgNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 规则每次修改 version+1，并在 audit_logs 记录 before/after；决策记录里会快照当时版本，保证可重放。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "7Bj9g",
                      "name": "cfgNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 名单库需支持五个实体维度：user / phone / ip / device / address（E07.entity_type）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "3UjGt",
                      "name": "cfgNote5",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "6. 批量导入需给模板下载与错误行明细，与运营助手/提单类项目的导入体验保持一致。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}